  "solution": "Given: j _ m b _ a _ _ u _ b _ a d j _ m _ b _ d\n\nBy checking options and substituting accordingly.\n\n1) u b m j m b u b a** → **j **__u__** m b **__b__** a **__m__** **-** **__j__** u **__m__** b **__b__** a d **- **j **__u__** m **__b__** b **__a__** d\n\n2) u b d j m b j b a** → **j **__u__** m b **__b__** a **__d__** **-** **__j__** u **__m__** b **__b__** a d **- **j **__j__** m **__b__** b **__a__** d\n\n**3) ****u b d j m b u b a**** →** j **__u__** m b **__b__** a **__d__** **-** **__j__** u **__m__** b **__b__** a d **- **j **__u__** m **__b__** b **__a__** d\n\n__\n \n• Here \" j **u__** m b **__b__** a **__d__**\" is repeated itself.\n\n4) u b d j m b u m a → j **__u__** m b **__b__** a **__d__** **-** **__j__** u **__m__** b **__b__** a d **- **j **__u__** m **__m__** b **__a__** d\n\n__\n \n• Option (3) gives a pattern of **j u__ m b __b__ a __d__ - **__j__ u __m__ b __b__ a d** - j __u__ m __b__ b __a__ d****.**\n\nHence, **‘****u b d j m b u b a’** is the correct answer",
